{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41178","headline":"观太常奏新乐 · 孔德绍","name":"观太常奏新乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大君膺宝历，出豫表功成。\n钧天金石响，洞庭弦管清。\n八音动繁会，九变叶希声。\n和云留睿赏，熏风悦圣情。\n盛烈光韶濩，易俗迈咸英。\n窃吹良无取，率舞拚羣生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孔德绍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}